                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Definitions for CPP Revenue</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8'>1. </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Pro-rated CPP Revenue</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'> : CPP Revenue is pro-rated based on the number of days that the CPP booking was live. E.g. If CPP booking was cancelled mid-month and was running for only 15 days, the revenue will be pro-rated based on these 15 days.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8'>2. </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Non pro-rated CPP Revenue</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'>: CPP Revenue is </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'>NOT </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#e20c6a' fontsize='8' italic='true'>pro-rated. E.g. If booking is cancelled during the month, CPP Revenue will be 0.</run>
